$comment
Formaldehyde, B3LYP/cc-pVTZ, pure d and f, no symmetry (Azimuth: the order of the pure functions)
$end

$molecule
0 1
  C     0.210000    -0.130000     0.080000
  O     0.669265    -1.125763     0.579557
  H     0.800180     0.806532    -0.011722
  H    -0.827630    -0.096387    -0.314984
$end

$rem
  METHOD               B3LYP
  BASIS                cc-pVTZ
  PURECART             11111
  SYM_IGNORE           TRUE
  SYMMETRY             FALSE
  PRINT_GENERAL_BASIS  TRUE
  PRINT_ORBITALS       200
$end
